287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 190 0 R
/E (Money Laundering \(ML\), Terrorism Financing \(TF\) and Proliferation Financing \(PF\) pose a significant threat to national security, the integrity of professional and business services, and the stability of both national and global financial systems. To address these threats, Kenya has undertaken several risk assessments to identify the specific vulnerabilities and establish effective control measures.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
