292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1345 0 R
/E (Involvement of intermediaries in transactions within the real estate sector with the intention of concealing Beneficial Ownership\(BO\) and source of funds; and)
/Pg 13 0 R
